# The preview image's old, unversioned URL.
#
# Must stay ABOVE the catch-all. Without this rule `/social-preview.png` falls
# through to `/index.html` and answers 200 text/html — so a crawler cache that
# DOES revalidate would replace a stale-but-valid image with an HTML document
# and the preview would break outright, which is worse than the stale image we
# are fixing. 301 sends those caches to the current asset instead.
#
# Generated by scripts/build-social-preview.mjs; the hash is the image's own.
/social-preview.png  /social-preview.7a4dd3e0.png  301

